      "consecutive_fetch_failures": 0,
      "consecutive_quiet_periods": 0,
      "notes": "Added 2026-05-06; demoted 2026-05-07 after a 302-to-login on every /api/ path. | 2026-05-07 (later): re-enabled. The SPA's HTTP 302/405 was caused by the routine container's User-Agent being filtered by the publisher; the dashboard's TLP:CLEAR slice is fully public when fetched with a normal browser User-Agent. Two endpoints serve the public slice anonymously: GET /api/posts/dashboard?pageSize=N&pageIndex=0 returns the listing, and GET /api/posts/{id}/details returns the full TLP:CLEAR Markdown body. The brief MUST cite the canonical SPA URL https://security-hub.ncsc.admin.ch/#/posts/{id} (not the API path). The repo ships tools/fetch_source.py as the documented bridge: `python3 tools/fetch_source.py ncsc-csh recent 10` returns listing + content in one call. Posts marked TLP:AMBER / TLP:RED MUST NEVER be fetched even if the API exposes them."
    },
